   "Notes": "Resolved 2026-08-02 from the research-first scoring pass (OQ-9). Flagship trio: EXP-01 (crop drought-index, rural smallholders), EXP-02 (clean-energy PAYGO, energy/enterprise), EXP-06 (multi-peril parametric climate cover, urban informal settlements). Chosen for three uncorrelated risk drivers (the pooling thesis) plus clean measurability; EXP-01 and EXP-06 share a parametric measurement design, making parallel RCTs under one verification partner affordable. Selection is subject to the verification partner confirming design feasibility (OQ-7). SUPERSEDED 2026-08-22 by OQ-15. The flagship-trio answer no longer stands: the 30-experiment scoring pass placed EXP-01, EXP-02 and EXP-06 in the Reserve band, and BB resolved OQ-15 as a sequenced portfolio instead - two desk-executable falsification tests first (EXP-25, EXP-22), then a single field anchor. The trio is not dropped: EXP-01 and EXP-06 remain field-anchor candidates alongside EXP-09 and EXP-10 under OQ-16. Row kept per CLAUDE.md section 3 - superseded is marked, not deleted.",
